1
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,800
The victim is Zhou Yawen.

2
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,120
Nine years ago, her husband, Gu Zhicheng,
reported her missing,

3
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,400
claiming she left a text
about going on a trip

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,600
and then lost contact.

5
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,330
A week later,

6
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,460
her body was found in a suburban pond.

7
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,200
The cause of death was
mechanical asphyxiation.

8
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,520
Hemp rope fibers were detected
on her neck.

9
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,040
The forensic examiner estimated

10
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:40,880
the time of death to be

11
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:43,560
between July 19 and July 20, 2014.

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,160
No DNA of Zhao Nanfeng

13
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,360
was found on the body.

14
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:48,560
Then why did it point to Zhao Nanfeng,

15
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,240
and why was she only convicted of theft?

16
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:52,170
In the early hours of July 20, 2014,

17
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:54,080
Zhao Nanfeng went to withdraw money

18
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:54,880
with Zhou Yawen's bank card.

19
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:56,680
Zhao Nanfeng is 1.75 meters tall

20
00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:58,490
and disguised her appearance.

21
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:01,480
The police initially thought
the person withdrawing money was a man,

22
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:03,960
but later realized it was a woman

23
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:06,480
by observing the details
of Zhao Nanfeng's movements.

24
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,600
Zhao Nanfeng stole 480,000 yuan

25
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,560
in batches within a week

26
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:10,640
for gambling.

27
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,720
After confirming that Zhao Nanfeng

28
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:13,440
was the suspect who stole

29
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:14,240
Zhou Yawen's bank card,

30
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:16,240
the police reviewed
her itinerary for that day.

31
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,280
They found that she

32
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:19,920
picked up Zhou Yawen from Youyi Road

33
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,580
at 10:30 p.m. on July 19, 2014.

34
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:22,640
This was also the last time

35
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:24,720
Zhou Yawen appeared on surveillance.

36
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:26,360
After Zhao Nanfeng was arrested,

37
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:28,160
she confessed that Zhou Yawen's husband
was having an affair,

38
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:30,360
and they were going to the neighboring
city to catch him in the act that night.

39
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,520
They had a fight on the way,

40
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:33,720
so she dropped Zhou Yawen off by the road
in the suburbs

41
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,160
and drove back to the city alone.

42
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:36,759
Her husband was having an affair.

43
00:01:36,759 --> 00:01:37,800
Is he a suspect?

44
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:40,520
The police investigated her husband
for three months back then,

45
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:41,759
but found no clues.

46
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:42,800
In that case,

47
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,240
Zhao Nanfeng knew Zhou Yawen's
bank card password.

48
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,900
What was their relationship?

49
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,130
Business partners.

50
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:51,400
Zhou Yawen's bank card password

51
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,600
was her own birthday.

52
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:55,000
It was written in
Zhao Nanfeng's confession.

53
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,759
She originally just wanted
to give it a try,

54
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:58,360
but didn't expect to guess it right
on the first try.

55
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:01,890
Then it seems the evidence for the crime
of theft is conclusive.

56
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,120
The police found Zhou Yawen's phone

57
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,650
in a trash can near the bank.

58
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:06,800
Zhao Nanfeng's fingerprints

59
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:07,920
were detected on it.

60
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,520
In addition,

61
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:10,440
Zhao Nanfeng used Zhou Yawen's phone

62
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:12,500
to send a text message to Gu Zhicheng.

63
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:24,240
Honey,

64
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,000
I'm going out for a few days.

65
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,160
I won't be home for a while.

66
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,840
After sending the text,

67
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,160
Zhao Nanfeng turned off the phone

68
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,760
and tossed it into the trash.

69
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:32,850
Look at this.

70
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:41,730
This isn't like you.

71
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,400
Just get straight to the point.

72
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,200
Have some tea.

73
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,040
I knew it.

74
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,640
Nothing gets past you.

75
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:51,680
Then...

76
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:53,450
I'll just be direct.

77
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,000
It's about Zhou Yawen's case.

78
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:59,260
Wei and the team are preparing the files.

79
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:02,330
We want to restart
the trial supervision procedure.

80
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,320
Prosecutor Qiao,

81
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:09,650
you've always taught us

82
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,800
to defend justice

83
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,080
and have compassion.

84
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:14,860
I don't think
you've let this case go either.

85
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,400
You watched Wei and me

86
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,079
grow into who we are today.

87
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,050
You know our determination

88
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,940
and our capabilities.

89
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,320
We want to give this case another try.

90
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:26,720
I know what's on your mind,

91
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:28,920
and emotionally, I can understand you.

92
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,200
But I want you

93
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:32,600
to drop this idea right now.

94
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,260
Don't even think about it.

95
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,040
But,

96
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,940
come sit down and talk.

97
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,079
Zhao Nanfeng,

98
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,620
Who are you?

99
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:56,760
Do I know you?

100
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,960
Your bluffing technique

101
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,440
is pretty basic.

102
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:09,440
I've been hustling for years,

103
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,580
so I've seen a thing or two.

104
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,760
Come back and ask me

105
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:17,290
when you actually find something.

106
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,760
You're that little sidekick

107
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,400
of the prosecutor

108
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:23,660
from back then, right?

109
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,720
You seem to be in a good mood.

110
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,050
What do you want from me?

111
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,520
Have you dreamed of Zhou Yawen

112
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,960
in the past nine years?

113
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:35,640
I bet you have.

114
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,660
Hey beautiful,

115
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:03,040
can I get your number?

116
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,040
So you finally showed up.

117
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,360
My sister.

118
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,000
Oh, my sister.

119
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:15,330
You've lost weight.

120
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:16,480
You'd lose weight too

121
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,680
if you did nine years.

122
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:18,720
This hairstyle...

123
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,250
I've never seen you with it.

124
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:22,700
You look sharp.

125
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:26,880
Get in.

126
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,810
I'll take you for a spin.

127
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:32,080
Let me show you
how bustling Beitan is now.

128
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:32,720
Take me home first

129
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,320
so I can change.

130
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,520
Look at what I'm wearing.

131
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:35,320
And my hair...

132
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,450
It's so ugly.

133
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:37,640
Says who?

134
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,600
My sister is a natural beauty.

135
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,130
She looks good in anything.

136
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,480
Prosecutor Qiao,

137
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:49,050
the victim's family member

138
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:50,320
hasn't given up.

139
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,650
He comes every year.

140
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,960
How are we supposed to

141
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:53,680
face him?

142
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,080
And when will this case

143
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,600
ever end?

144
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:57,680
This case

145
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,900
has almost reached a dead end.

146
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,840
It's been nine years.

147
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,280
You want to reopen it now.

148
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,860
Can you find new evidence?

149
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,720
Things are different now.

150
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,240
Technology is advancing rapidly.

151
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,840
Maybe there will be a new breakthrough.

152
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:11,320
Even with a one percent chance,

153
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,120
we shouldn't give up.

154
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,180
You taught me that.

155
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:15,850
Besides,

156
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,720
even if we fail,

157
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,560
at least we can give
the family an explanation

158
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,490
when we see them.

159
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,920
Until there is clear evidence,

160
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:29,180
I won't request a retrial from the court.

161
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,720
Thank you, Prosecutor Qiao.

162
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,330
Here.

163
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,050
What is this?

164
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,120
See for yourself.

165
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,650
Zhao Nanfeng

166
00:06:39,880 --> 00:06:40,680
is getting out of prison today.

167
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,240
At this time,

168
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,300
we should consider

169
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:44,200
if the family might overreact.

170
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,280
So,

171
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:47,170
I suggest you go see Zhou Yajun.

172
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:48,280
Understood.

173
00:06:48,280 --> 00:06:49,640
We'll definitely have
a good talk with him,

174
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:50,640
and calm him down.

175
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,120
Remember one thing.

176
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,680
Until we are absolutely sure,

177
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:56,340
never mention the protest
against the verdict.

178
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:57,980
Kaixin,

179
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,780
I wonder where Prosecutor Fang went.

180
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,620
Should we take a break?

181
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,640
My eyes are sore.

182
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:04,880
No.

183
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:05,920
Since she's not here,

184
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,650
we need to be even more careful.

185
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,000
Okay.

186
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:12,450
What?

187
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:14,720
What did you even put together here?

188
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:16,480
Can you be a bit more reliable?

189
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:18,280
My notes have always been messy.

190
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,610
Then you tell me.

191
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:21,720
What have you figured out
after looking at it for so long?

192
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,450
Then I'll tell you all about it.

193
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:24,570
Are you serious?

194
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:27,920
The police found
Zhou Yawen's blood and hair

195
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:30,440
on the car roof and under the back seats.

196
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:33,520
But these don't form
a complete chain of evidence.

197
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:37,120
Back then, there was
a prosecutor named Zhang Min.

198
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,760
He had new evidence at the time.

199
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:40,360
But nothing came of it later.

200
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:42,020
Prosecutor Zhang Min?

201
00:07:42,159 --> 00:07:44,159
Isn't he Prosecutor Fang's mentor?

202
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:48,800
That's right.

203
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:49,730
He was my mentor.

204
00:07:50,159 --> 00:07:52,620
He was the prosecutor
in charge of this case.

205
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:57,920
I remember my mentor coming to me
excitedly back then,

206
00:07:58,280 --> 00:08:00,040
saying he found new clues

207
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:03,720
and asking me to interrogate
Zhao Nanfeng with him.

208
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:05,920
The clerk at the print shop
identified you,

209
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:08,050
claiming that before the incident...

210
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:10,720
Zhao Nanfeng,

211
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:11,640
will you talk,

212
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,520
or should I?

213
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,440
I didn't print anything.

214
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,560
I don't know what you're talking about.

215
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,020
You're trying to bluff me.

216
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:33,500
Since you claim I printed something,

217
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,980
tell me what I printed.

218
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,840
You didn't delete the backup
on the print shop's hard drive,

219
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,880
did you?

220
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:47,920
I'll say it again.

221
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:51,320
I didn't print anything.

222
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:53,770
If you really found something,

223
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,440
why bother asking me?

224
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:57,860
Prosecutor Zhang,

225
00:08:58,440 --> 00:09:00,080
your bluffing tactics...

226
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,560
It's too ordinary.

227
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:06,800
I've been working in society
for so many years,

228
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:09,000
so I've seen a lot.

229
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:12,880
Master.

230
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:15,080
Is there nothing we can do

231
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,640
to stop her from being so arrogant?

232
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,170
Don't we have new evidence?

233
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,440
When we found it,

234
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:20,560
the computer was flooded

235
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:22,220
and the hard drive was broken.

236
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:25,090
Fang Wei,

237
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:26,680
sometimes when handling a case,

238
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:28,080
we're just one step away.

239
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,610
We have to accept it.

240
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,840
I won't accept it.

241
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,560
I don't believe

242
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:34,280
there's a case in this world
that can't be prosecuted.

243
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:34,810
Fang Wei,

244
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:37,010
I haven't given up on this case.

245
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,740
But now is not the time.

246
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:41,600
Maybe there will be a chance
in the future.

247
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:44,000
But I only have a few years left
before retirement.

248
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,840
Maybe I won't live to see that day.

249
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,360
If this case is handed over to you,

250
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:49,560
I hope you remember what you said today.

251
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:51,960
Master,

252
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:53,210
I will remember.

253
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,080
So I've never let go

254
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,600
of this case.

255
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:58,680
Prosecutor Fang,

256
00:09:58,760 --> 00:09:59,480
you can definitely do it.

257
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,410
I believe in you.

258
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:01,970
This isn't just my case.

259
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,640
It's everyone's case.

260
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,700
Prosecutor Xu,

261
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,080
how did it go?

262
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:08,760
Did Prosecutor Qiao agree?

263
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:09,220
Yishan,

264
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,120
Prosecutor Qiao

265
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:12,760
didn't agree

266
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:14,880
to us initiating
the trial supervision protest.

267
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:15,160
Prosecutor Qiao!

268
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:15,840
Why is he so...

269
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:16,520
But

270
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:19,040
Prosecutor Qiao didn't say
we couldn't investigate.

271
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,320
He also told us

272
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,040
to give it our all.

273
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,720
Why is he so nice?

274
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:29,420
So do we have a starting point now?

275
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,560
The hard drive couldn't be repaired

276
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,400
back then due to limited technology.

277
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:35,460
If we can fix it now,

278
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,440
we might find new clues.

279
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,260
That's a great direction.

280
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:41,200
Technology is advancing rapidly.

281
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:43,200
Many cold cases are solved this way.

282
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:44,080
Let's do this,

283
